# The build context is streamed to the Docker daemon on every build, and this image needs
# exactly one file out of the whole module: the packaged WAR. Without this, each deploy
# would ship src/, the exploded target/ReimbursementManagement-<version>/ directory, and
# the surefire/jacoco reports across the socket for nothing.
#
# Docker (unlike git) evaluates every pattern against each path and takes the LAST match,
# so re-including a file inside an excluded directory works as written here.
*
!target/ReimbursementManagement-*.war
